    "reason": "T30 Native90 initial CallsService PG new-handshake timeout returns HTTP500 although pool idle1 before/idle2 after failure and no queued checkout. Locked pg-pool source and realPG TCP proxy RED2/4 reproduce ready-backend loss before BEGIN; no-idle timeout and non-timeout database failure controls pass. On exact new-handshake timeout only, acquire an existing idle client once when no waiter precedes us; no transaction replay, no wait/backoff/config/deadline/authorization changes. Preserve BEGIN/UTC/body/COMMIT/ROLLBACK/release exact; original call/lease/quota regressions and full headed native remain required.",
